<title>USA: NGC names new head of Global Energy unit.</title>
<headline>NGC names new head of Global Energy unit.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>NGC Corp said Thursday James H. Current has been named president of NGC Global Energy, the company's international division, and senior vice president of NGC.</p>
<p>It said Current succeeds Mark L. Hazelwood who has resigned, effective September 23. Hazelwood will resume his career with Atlantic Richfield Co, where he had held a number of management positions over the last 17 years before joining NGC in March.</p>
<p>Current joined NGC in April after retiring from the Royal Dutch/Shell Group's Shell Oil Co in March.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
